WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,760
That's it

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,360
No matter what Jingyi thinks

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:07,760
this is what i should do

4
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,740
