16
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,820
A legal statement

17
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,020
Clear it all together

18
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:48,820
Obviously the handle of the audit

19
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:51,220
However, it angered Kakume and also sent the chat history.

20
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:55,440
That's to be expected. Hello everyone, I'm Miko.
